& [InitialSliceQueue] is the first clean subdivision sequence
  + [slice_candidate] is kernel-record-schema-design
    + [portion_ref] is P2
    + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
    + [reason] is natural keys, authority states, and source/projection distinction are architecture-level decisions
    + [verification_oracle] is schema review against valid, stale, blocked, contradicted, and invalid fixture cases
  + [slice_candidate] is operator-contract-template-design
    + [portion_ref] is P3
    + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
    + [reason] is compiled SOP duty boundaries are authority-sensitive
    + [verification_oracle] is template review against signature_validation and support_readiness_recompute examples
  + [slice_candidate] is storage-backend-decision
    + [portion_ref] is P2
    + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
    + [reason] is physical model affects source preservation, query, concurrency, Git workflow, and LangGraph integration
    + [verification_oracle] is decision record with tradeoffs and invalidation conditions
    + [precondition] is logical schema draft exists
  + [slice_candidate] is fixture-pack-generation
    + [portion_ref] is P8
    + [model_route] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after schema and operator contracts stabilize
    + [reason] is bounded fixture generation with clear expected states
    + [verification_oracle] is fixture validation tests
  + [slice_candidate] is manager-worker-debug-surface-projections
    + [portion_ref] is P6
